# ── AlterCPA / collabBox history import (2026-08-05) ──
# Customer PII and bulk data. The raw export alone is 69 MB of names, phones and
# addresses for 81k orders; the collabBox registers and the correction audit are
# name-bearing too. All of them are regenerable:
#   node scripts/export-altercpa-mk.mjs        → altercpa-mk-raw.jsonl
#   node scripts/match-collabbox.mjs --apply   → collabbox-corrections.*
# The curated, reviewable artefacts (product map, analysis, correction summary)
# ARE committed — those are decisions, not customer data.
scripts/data/altercpa-mk-raw.jsonl
scripts/data/altercpa-import-done.txt
scripts/data/altercpa-import-payload-sample.json
scripts/data/collabbox-corrections.csv
LeadIn*.xls
LeadOut*.xls

.vercel

# OSM/GeoNames download cache for the MK address importers (3.7 MB, re-fetchable)
scripts/data/osm-cache/

# MEX register cache — regenerate with scripts/fetch-mex-shipments.mjs
scripts/data/mex-shipments.json
